# =============================================================================
# v4.0.0 File Governance Rule (2026-09-08)
# =============================================================================
# *.log, *.tbl, *.json files are NOT allowed in commits
# Exception: Cargo.toml, package.json, tsconfig.json, *.config.json, docs/governance/*.json
*.log
*.tbl
# JSON files - most are disallowed (allowed list below)
*.json
# Allowlist exceptions
!**/Cargo.toml
!**/package.json
!**/tsconfig.json
!**/.gitignore
!**/.gitattributes
!**/*.config.json
!**/docs/governance/*.json
!**/docs/releases/*/manifest.json
!**/docs/releases/*/evidence/*/summary.json
!**/.claude/**/*.json
!**/.gitea/workflows/*.json

